{
  "Script": "Story/AC42/Day01/Novel/AC42_01_07_02",
  "Entries": [
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00285_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Alright, I'll deal the finishing blow...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00286_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "The killing blow is mine. Die!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800020_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Eh?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00287_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "But I wanted to finish it off!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00288_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "This is all it can do? What a disappointment...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00289_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "What do you mean, \"a disappointment\"?! Maria, I was supposed to finish it off, wasn't I?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00290_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "There were other unplanned actions, as well.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00292_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Acting on your own disrupts the chain of command. What if it ended up throwing off Vritika's calculations?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00295_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "...My body moves on its own whenever I see Cancer.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00296_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "What I did is also against your instruction, Vritika... Coordination, is hard...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00297_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "You were tryin' to cover for me, right? But I'd have been good either way, you can trust me on that.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00298_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "However, it is also a fact that following Maria's independent action, our attacks increased in ferocity and elimination speed.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00299_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "This comes naturally to me.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00300_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "No! We have to work on our coordination tomorrow!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00301_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(Is this to say that in the end, our typical fighting style is what sits best with everyone?)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00302_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Looks like the engineer team is pulling out for today, so we can head back.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00303_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes, we will resume tomorrow.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    }
  ],
  "Inserts": []
}